  "content": "[Verse 1]\n[E]We\nused to have it all\n[Bm9]Like Chi-\ncago Bulls in\n[A]ninety three,\n[Am]\nmmm\n[E]Then\ncame that civil war\n[Bm9]Now\ntexting you is like a\n[A]battlefield\n[Am]\nWe are\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#m]strangers,\n[B/D#][E7]who share a\n[A]photograph\n[G#7][G#/B#]Like that\n[C#m]submarine,\n[B/D#][E7]that never\n[A]made it back\n[D7]For-\n[E6]ever wasn't\n[B/E]meant to come as\n[Bm/E]fast In this\n[Emaj7]moment [Eaug]all we\n[A]have is an\n[F#m]empty photo-\n[Esus2]graph\n[A]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E]Mmm We\nused to face the storms\n[Bm9]Singing\nBruce Springsteen and\n[A]Joe Dassin,\noh yeah,\n[Am]\noh\n[E]But\ntime will claim it's toll\n[Bm9]Like\ngravity and\n[A]nicotine,\n[Am]yeah\nWe are\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#m]strangers,\n[B/D#][E7]who share a\n[A]photograph\n[G#7][G#/B#]Like that\n[C#m]submarine,\n[B/D#][E7]that never\n[A]made it back\n[D7]For-\n[E6]ever wasn't\n[B/E]meant to come as\n[Bm/E]fast In this\n[Emaj7]moment [Eaug]all we\n[A]have is an\n[F#m]empty photo-\n[Esus2]graph\n[A]\n\n[Outro]\n[Esus2]\n[A]\n[E]",
